# Design System

Design style:
- Clean
- Minimal
- Premium
- Trustworthy
- Mobile-first
- Fast-loading
- Conversion-focused

Preferred visual style:
- White background
- Navy or blue primary color
- Soft gray sections
- Rounded cards
- Clear CTA buttons
- Simple icons
- Large spacing
- Professional typography
- No unnecessary animation

Every public page should include:
- Strong headline
- Short supporting text
- Clear CTA
- Trust signals
- FAQ where useful
- Contact/consultation CTA

Use shadcn/ui components where helpful:
- Button
- Card
- Input
- Textarea
- Select
- Dialog
- Table
- Badge
- Dropdown menu
- Form

Rules:
- Keep layouts responsive.
- Avoid visual clutter.
- Do not use random colors.
- Reuse Button, Section, Container, Card, and Form components.
- Keep dashboard UI clean and data-focused.
